  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104882/description_c6eb1764-b109-4e95-9ba2-9d0621f0e64b.png\"></p><p>這是一個函式庫模組！如果您不是開發者，無需擔心。它很可能是您模組包中其他模組的依賴項。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104882/description_2158d9d6-4a3c-4bff-9dd9-81061aab7627.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Txni&amp;labelColor=36633c&amp;color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/TxniLib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Github&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=666666&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=CurseForge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=33de61&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a></strong></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104882/description_410fddf2-ea88-4b14-90b3-e867e93d9ac3.png\"></p><p>如果您是開發者，您好！這個函式庫是專為搭配我的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftemplate.txni.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">多版本模板模組</a>而設計，我使用該模板從同一程式碼庫同步在 Forge 與 Fabric 平台的 1.20 和 1.21 版本發布模組。除了我發現實用的各種小工具外，這個模組主要包含平台與版本的特定實作，以減少在跨版本維護專案時重複的 if/else 條件判斷。歡迎您使用它，但文件說明將視我額外時間而定提供。</p>",
